  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492540/diamond-spheres-harmony-and-discord?affiliate_id=3028400\">Diamond Spheres: Harmony &amp; Discord</a></sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Performance sphere ((instrumental) package or (lyric) package).</p>\n<p>Enemies affected by this instrumental or lyric become sickened.</p>\n<p><em>Sickening Note:</em> When used as an instrumental, if you maintain the instrumental on your next turn, enemies that fail their saving throw against the instrumental become nauseated for 1 round–on a successful save, the creature becomes immune to this effect for 1 round.</p>\n<p><em>Sick Burn:</em> When used as a discouraging lyric, the target also suffers 1d6 points of fire damage for every 2 ranks in the package’s associated skill you possess. At the start of each subsequent turn, , the target must succeed at a Will saving throw at the start of each turn or catch fire. If the lyric is expended, the affected creature gains fire vulnerability for 3 rounds.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/performance#toc60\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
